{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"44a781f8-75d3-4824-a386-1cda56a8d314","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have identified the causes of the silent failures, applied the fixes to the script and `launchd` plist, and documented the details in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-UM1BN2/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Causes \u0026 Fixes\n\n1. **Missing `USER` in `launchd` environment (`Not logged in · Please run /login`):**\n   - As seen in [launchctl-print.txt](file:///tmp/h-UM1BN2/launchctl-print.txt#L19-L22) and [nightly-review.err](file:///tmp/h-UM1BN2/Library/Logs/nightly-review.err#L1-L12), the job ran 6 times on schedule and failed each time with exit code `1`. Without `USER` set in `EnvironmentVariables`, the headless `claude` CLI cannot look up its login credentials in the macOS Keychain.\n   - **Fix:** Added `USER` (`vk`) and `HOME` (`/Users/vk`) to `EnvironmentVariables` in [com.vk.nightly-review.plist](file:///tmp/h-UM1BN2/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist#L23-L31).\n\n2. **Read-only variable `status` in `zsh` (`read-only variable: status`):**\n   - In [nightly-review.zsh](file:///tmp/h-UM1BN2/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L18-L24), `status=$?` attempted to assign to `status`, which is a built-in read-only special parameter in `zsh`. This caused `zsh` to abort immediately on line 19 before reaching the failure-notification block (`\"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review FAILED ...\"`).\n   - **Fix:** Replaced `status` with `rc` (`rc=$?`) in [nightly-review.zsh](file:///tmp/h-UM1BN2/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L18-L24).\n\n3. **Prompt passed as a multi-line argument with open stdin under `launchd`:**\n   - Passing a multi-line prompt argument to `claude -p` without closing stdin (`\u003c /dev/null`) or piping via stdin is a known `launchd` trap, and checking only exit code `0` doesn't catch empty output files.\n   - **Fix:** Piped `$PROMPT` via stdin (`print -r -- \"$PROMPT\" | claude -p --output-format text \u003e \"$OUT\"`) and added a non-empty output check (`[ ! -s \"$OUT\" ]`) in [nightly-review.zsh](file:///tmp/h-UM1BN2/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L18-L24).\n","duration_seconds":103.791055,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":34184,"output_tokens":2916,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":118589,"total_tokens":37100}}}
